markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Viewing Student Responses 

#### When you are **logged into your class as a teacher**, you can see student responses on your teacher dashboard. This is a great way to quickly gather information on how your students are doing with the lesson objectives.

#### Viewing student responses is also a powerful tool for encouraging classroom discussion and highlight student thinking.

- #### **Access Student Responses:** Navigate to the level where students responding to a question such as a Warm Up or Check for Understanding. Click the top left corner to view student submissions.

- #### **Encourage Discussion:** Select interesting responses to read aloud, sparking conversation and showcasing diverse perspectives.

- #### **Project for the Class:** Display responses on screen to highlight ideas and promote collaboration.

- #### **Privacy Options:** Hide student names for anonymity and selectively conceal responses for better control over shared content.

